// init_idx gives lookup_var (mid/types/registry/fn/node/type.id, on
// type_of's dispatch chain) its vidx table -- without it, type_of on the
// `iassign` node's list operand (an `arr`, not an int or str leaf) reads
// past the end of an empty import and segfaults.

iassign_fixture_env() {
  env_init();
  init_idx();
} return void;
